The files in the directories below are unmodified copies of files from
IntelliJ IDEA, build named by the directory:

- *.theme.json: platform/platform-resources/src/themes/ in
  https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community (tag idea/<build>).
- DefaultColorSchemesManager.xml: lib/intellij.platform.resources.jar of the IDE.
- additional-attributes.json: the additionalTextAttributes files that bundled
  plugins register for the Default and Darcula schemes, collected by
  scripts/extract-ide-schemes.py.

